+    'A coordinate-only CSV does not define restoration of calibration, names/groups, full contours, landmarks or processing settings. Editable names and duplicate upload basenames leave identity unresolved. The spec does not say whether changing controls mutates saved outlines, whether symmetrization occurs before or after GPA and renormalization, or which measurements remain raw. Averaging with a mirror can change centroid size.',
